Package: wine-ipv6only
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: LD_PRELOAD library that forces IPV6_V6ONLY for Wine games
 Some Windows games bind a dual-stack IPv6 socket and then an IPv4 socket on
 the same port. Windows allows that; Linux refuses the IPv4 bind, so under
 Wine the game can't host LAN games. gamelaunch preloads this library (from
 /opt/wine-ipv6only, which umu's container can see) for the games that need
 it; it forces IPV6_V6ONLY=1 so both sockets bind as they do on Windows.
